D>\nMeun nga liguey ak assistant virtuel wala kene si sa ligueyoukay koula meuna defaral cv si nonou rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3213,"row":{"en":"And so it was.","wo":"Nimu ko waxee noonu la amee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNimouko wakhe nonoula amé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3214,"row":{"en":"Instead the healthy are put under house arrest and where exactly are all those sick people?","wo":"Lu moy loolu yu wér yi deñu leen di def ci biir néegu teye. Waaye ñu feebar ñooñu ana ñu?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou moy lolou you wérr yi dégnou léne di def si biir négu teuyé wayé gnou fébar gnognou ana gnou?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3215,"row":{"en":"I mean, if he can drink that much coffee and still function, then he's definitely got some serious willpower.","wo":"Sudee moo mëna naan kafe gu bari nii ba noppi wéy di doxal, jàpp naa ni ku am pastéef la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé mo meuna nane café gu bari nii ba nopi way di dokhal, diap na ni kou ame pastééf la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3216,"row":{"en":"A school of sharks follows the boat, and they begin to eat the marlin.","wo":"Ay gaynde géej topp gaal gi, ñu tàmbali di lekk jën wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy gayndé guedj top gal gui, gnou tambali di lekk dieun wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3217,"row":{"en":"It should make the chart a bit easier to interpret at a glance.","wo":"Dina tax soo xoolee rek di nga mëna tekki li graafik bi di wax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina takh soo kholé rek di nga meuna tekki li grafik bi di wakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3218,"row":{"en":"I mean, it's not fair to the responsible businesses that are following the rules when some other places are just selling liquor to anyone who walks in the door.","wo":"Lima bëgga wax mooy du yoon yenn barabi liggéey di def seen wareef, fekk yeneen barab yi di jaay sàngara képp ku ñëw seen barab ngir jënd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima beuga wakh moy dou yone yenn barabi ligueye di def sen waref fek yenen barab yi di jaay sangara kep kou nieuw sen barab nguir dieundé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3219,"row":{"en":"We will acknowledge your complaint within 5 working days and inform you of how we will intend to resolve the dispute.","wo":"Dina nu la jox firnde ni jot nañu sa plainte ci diiru 5 fani liggéey ba noppi nu wax la naka lanu nara saafaraa jafe-jafe bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina gnou la diokh firndé ni diot nagnou sa plainte thi diirou 5 fani liguey ba noppi gnou wakh la naka lagnou nara safara diafé-diafé bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3220,"row":{"en":"If you're always slouching and your clothes are rumpled, it shows that you don't care about yourself.","wo":"Sooy sol yéere yu la ëpp ba noppi jaxasoo, loolu dafay wane ni doo toppatoo sa bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy sol yéré youla eup ba nopi diakhasso lolou dafay wané ni doo topato sa boppé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3221,"row":{"en":"Kosher food is prepared in a way that ensures that it is fit for consumption according to Jewish law.","wo":"Ñamu kosher dañu koy togg ci anam wu méngoo ak niko yoonu Juif yi santaane balaa muy dagan a lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiamou kosher dagnou koy togue ci anam wou méngoo ak niko yonou djouif yi santané bala mouy dagane a lekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3222,"row":{"en":"One negative point associated with the crunchy nut cereal from Millville is that it is also high on sugar.","wo":"Menn mbir mi baaxul ci sereyaalu crunchy nut bu bawoo ci Millville mooy itam dafa bari suukër lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMene mbir mi bakhoul thi sereyale crunchy nut bou bawoo thi millville moy itam dafa bari soukeur lool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3223,"row":{"en":"Granddaughter goes back to watching TV.]","wo":"Sët bu jigéen bi dellu ci seetanum teleem.]","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSet bou djiguéne bi dellou si sétaneum téléem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3224,"row":{"en":"He then flew back up to the tree and started to stuff the leaves into the hole where the roots were exposed.","wo":"Ba noppi mu naaw dellu ci garab gi, mu jël xob yi dugal ko ci pax mi reeni garab gi di feeñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa noppi mou naw dellou si garab gui, mou dieul khob yi dougal ko si pakhe mi reeni garab gui di fegn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3225,"row":{"en":"Also, affirm if the mole trap supplier will be swift, prompt and punctual in their activities.","wo":"Nanga xool bu baax itam ndax ki lay jaay fiiru ngaaka (taupe) dina gaaw ci liggéey bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNanga khol bou bakh itam ndakh ki lay diay firou ngaaka (taupe) dina gaw thi liguey bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3226,"row":{"en":"It is also a good idea to take pictures of the car before you drive it away, so that you have proof of its condition in case of any damage.","wo":"Li gëna wóor mooy nga foto oto bi balaa nga koy yóbbu, suko defee nga mëna joxe firnde ci nimu meloon sudee coow da cee am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi geuna wor moy nga foto auto bi bala nga koy yobou, souko défé nga meuna diokhé firndé si nimou mélone soudé thiow da si am.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3227,"row":{"en":"Were it within my power to impart to you the incredibly detailed information concerning my deepest fear, I would do so without hesitation.","wo":"Suma Yàlla mayoon ma mëna dugg ci sa xel mi dindi ci lépp linga xam ci limay ragal, dama koy daal di def ci saasi, duma sax xaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSouma yalla mayone ma meuna dougg si sa hel mi dindi si lepp linga kham si limay ragal, dama koy daal di def si sassi, douma sakh khar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3228,"row":{"en":"The novel is a coming-of-age story, and it follows the princess as she grows from a sheltered young woman into a confident and capable adult.","wo":"Léeb bi dafay nettali jaar-jaaru joge ndaw jëm mag, di topp ab prinses buñu yoral léppam dem ba nekk mag mu wóolu boppam ba noppi mënal boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLééb bi dafay nétali diar diarou diogué ndaw dieum mag, di top ab princesse bouniou yoral lépam dem ba neuk mag mou wolou bopam ba nopi meunal bopam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3229,"row":{"en":"Trimming nails can be a stressful experience for some dogs, so it's important to make it a positive experience.","wo":"Xaj yu bari dañu ragal ñuy dagg seen we, kon dafay solo soo koy def, nga fexe bañu bëgg ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhaj you bari daniou ragal niouy dague seen we kon dafay solo sokoy def nga fekhé bagnou beug ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3230,"row":{"en":"My parents claim I taught myself to read, and set about reading everything within reach.","wo":"Samay waajur dañuy wax ni maa jàngal sama bopp lire, te luma musaan a jot lire ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSamay wadiour dagnouy wakh ni ma diangal sama bopp lire té louma meussane diote lire ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3231,"row":{"en":"It can be used to express emotions, tell stories, and explore complex ideas.","wo":"Mën nañu ko jëfandikoo ngir fësal ay yëg-yëg, nettali jaar-jaar, wax ci mbir yu jafee wax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnouko dieufandiko nguir feusal ay yeug yeug, netali diar diar, wakh thi mbir you diafé wakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3232,"row":{"en":"I'm just your friendly neighborhood Uber driver, here to take you wherever you need to go.","wo":"Man sofëru Uber la bu nekk ci boor yii, dama ñëw ngir yóbbu la fi nga bëgga dem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMan chauffeur Uber la bou neuk thi boor yii, dama nieuw nguir yobou la fi nga beuga dem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3233,"row":{"en":"You're still a warrior, and you still have a lot to offer the world.","wo":"Ba leegi xarekat nga, te dese lu bari lu mëna jariñ àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa légui kharekat nga té déssé lou bari lou meuna diariñ addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3234,"row":{"en":"Below, we list five useful styling tips that will make wide-leg pants spice up your winter wardrobe.","wo":"Ci suuf, indil nañu leen juróomi xeeti taaral pàntaloŋ yu yaatu tànk di, nara bokk ci say yéere sédd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi souf indil nagnou len diouromi kheuti taral pantalon you yatou tank di nara bok thi say yeure sédd.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3235,"row":{"en":"He was a healer, and he had come to help me.","wo":"Ab fajkat la woon, mu ñëwoon dima dimbali.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAb fadjakat la wone mou gneuwone dima dimbeuli.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3236,"row":{"en":"I'm tired of dealing with your childish behavior.","wo":"Dama tàyyi ci seen yëfi xale yu xamadi yii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama tayi si seen yeufi khalé you khamadi yii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3237,"row":{"en":"Farmers may rise before dawn to milk their cows or tend to their crops.","wo":"Baykat yi mënu jog balaa fajar ngir ratt seeni nag wala toppatoo seen gañcax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBaykat yi meunou diogue bala fadiar nguir rate seeni nag wala topato seeni ganthakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3238,"row":{"en":"The study found that the rate of false positives was higher among women who were younger, had dense breasts, and had a family history of breast cancer.","wo":"Gëstu bi dafa wane ni xeetu njuumte y