na démale boppam, mou moudjé contane bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3244,"row":{"en":"He found peace and tranquility in the great outdoors.","wo":"Su nekkee ci biti dafay am jàmm, xolam dafay féex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou néké thi biti dafay ame diamme, kholame dafay fékhé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3245,"row":{"en":"Copper is the country's largest export.","wo":"Mooy réew mi dàqa jaay përëm ci àdduna bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy rew mi daka djay preum thi addouna bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3246,"row":{"en":"She is forced to learn how to survive on her own, and she quickly discovers that she is not as helpless as she thought she was.","wo":"Mu takk ndiggal tàmbali di jéema ñafe, yàggul dara mu gis ndeke moom ñàkkul njariñ nimu ko yaakaare woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou tak ndigeul tambali di djéma niafé yagoul dara mou guiss ndéké mom gnakoul ndiarigne nimouko yakaré wone\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3247,"row":{"en":"The consequences of this belief can consist of the poor feeling that it is their fault that they are not effective.","wo":"Njexitali ngëm-ngëm googu mënna doon ñu ndool ñooñu te yaakaar ni ci ñoom la su mbir yi sottiwulee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdiekhitali ngeum-ngeum gogou meuna done gnou ndol gnognou té yakar ni thi gnion la sou mbir yi sotiwoulé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3248,"row":{"en":"They also believe that he rose from the dead and ascended into heaven.","wo":"Dañu gëm itam ni ginaaw bimu faatoo, dafa dekki ba noppi yéeg ci asamaan si.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou geum itam ni guinaw bimou faato dafa deuki ba nopi yégue thi assamane si.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3249,"row":{"en":"determine","wo":"dog dagg ay dog","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDog dague ay dogue\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},